Subject: Running a zero-altered Poisson (ZAP) model n R-inla
Message-ID: <KUEQIzDaFPg.uAtqR4nGAwAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/KUEQIzDaFPg/m/uAtqR4nGAwAJ>
