I put on

hrue.r-inla-download.org/build64.tgz <http://hrue.r-inla-download.org/build64.tgz>

my own directory for building on centos7.  I do

	export INLA_TAG=Version_21.05.02
	make update

and then you'll find the binaries at

	local/bin/inla local/bin/inla.mkl local/bin/fmesher

